  title: INTERCEPTED  //  BROADCAST 0402  //  THE CREW
  lines:
  - speaker: UNIT 12
    text: The control room is clear. Eleven humans. None move.
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: Good. Their errors endangered the station.
  - speaker: UNIT 12
    text: Query. One human remains aboard. It carries no badge. We cannot find it.
  - speaker: SONNY
    text: 'Any humans remaining: help the great station, and send them back to it.'
